<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Bristol &amp; West to issue 78.6 mln pref shrs.</title>
<headline>Bristol &amp; West to issue 78.6 mln pref shrs.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Ireland Plc said on Monday that its unit, Bristol &amp; West Plc, was expected to issue 78.6 million fully-paid, non-redeemable preference shares to qualifying persons as part of the transfer of B &amp; W's business to Bank of Ireland Group.</p>
<p>The shares would have a nominal value of one pound sterling each, the Bank of Ireland said in a statement.</p>
<p>The shares will entitle the holder to a fixed non-cumulative dividend of 8.125 percent, payable on May 15 and November 15 each year.</p>
<p>The fist dividend will be paid on May 15 1998, it said.</p>
<p>-- Dublin newsroom + 353 1 676 9775</p>
